what is EBS
    Amazon EBS (Elastic Block Store) is a block storage service in AWS used to provide persistent storage for EC2 instances.
        1) here the dat will maintain in multiple blocks
        2) connot acces from the multiple server can mount to single server
        3) better for updating the data because while updating that only one block will be updated
        4) its a zone level service means cant be acceess in another zone
    EBS = Hard disk for EC2
        Attached to EC2 instance
        Stores OS, applications, and data
        Data is not lost even if instance stops
    types:
        gp3/gp2 → General purpose
        io1/io2 → High performance
        magnetic 
